{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8d9848bb6bbcff4c24c38eaaa5600bf7a77e577240d7fa0ae6fbd30ce909c43b","ja":"本番に向けて、もっとラップに磨きをかけて\nおかなくちゃ。さっそく、練習はじめるわよ！","zh":"为了正式演出，得把说唱练得更精进才行。马上开始练习吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8ec398de9254b36c9c92317a5305629ea5736458d35709ffc9d6b42f9cbee4b3","ja":"おけおけ～！　んじゃ、亜美からいっくよ～ん。","zh":"好嘞好嘞～！那就从亚美开始喽～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4af3bdc2416bc39b6be877ea9a194e46f8b814a49b7eeb2ec0bf73ef33c23a19","ja":"Yes　双海インダハウス　Noある鷹はコメかくす\n亜美アンド真美の　ラッピン　マジヤバいっぽいYo！","zh":"Yes，双海在场　No，有只鹰把米藏起来了  \n亚美和真美的说唱　看起来真的超厉害，Yo！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506","ja":"……ん？","zh":"……嗯？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"16702ea94001fce45a52dbedf2f3128f9931c8eeb70f2771af4480de09a4053d","ja":"最近ちょっと不景気　吹っ飛ばすそのフインキ\nふたりそろえば無敵っしょ　必勝　楽勝　Yeah！","zh":"最近有点不景气，把这种气氛一扫而空  \n两个人齐上就是无敌吧，必胜，轻松获胜，Yeah！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"99e36aa191b000cbc2bd0c9eafc84ae78fbcb09becb063d47a4a6920579ba7f1","ja":"……ちょっと待って！　ストップ、ストーップ！\nふたりとも、言葉の間違いが多すぎじゃない？","zh":"……等一下！停，停一下！\n你们两个，是不是说错太多地方了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2e7b7a341488eeb4016d060db62338a047d25a321b350c7a4638d5a9198b0c91","ja":"能ある鷹が隠すのは「ツメ」！\n「ふいんき」じゃなくて「ふんいき」、でしょ！","zh":"有本事的鹰，藏的是“爪子”！\n不是“fuinki”，而是“funiki”，对吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8d7a4cb31c1da16fce6113f8c3c075af355e5965960ded67fa4131f4f4734820","ja":"んもー、律っちゃんってば細かいなー。\nラップはノリノリなのがいちばんっしょ～？","zh":"哎呀，律子真是太讲究细节了。说唱不就是要嗨起来才最好嘛～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7bb749507378cd96865623cba6dc5dcbb69a4759449958360486755fdd9b6572","ja":"ノリがよくても、伝わらなきゃ意味ないでしょ。\n……やっぱり、あんた達にはアレが必要みたいね。","zh":"就算气氛再好，传达不出去也没有意义吧。  \n……看来，你们果然还是需要那个呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"6fd778c3891b13bb4955f0f7861629d48e3fe85a2607452c1ec716ce7626dfae","ja":"亜美、真美！　語彙力をつけるための宿題よ！\nこの国語ドリルを三日後までにやってくること！","zh":"亚美、真美！这是为了提升词汇量的作业哦！\n三天后之前要把这本国语练习册做完！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"fff4fc472a3b702c5879e9334e886bd2737da497e2de06f9d3d76c7640622c71","ja":"えええ～～っ！？　宿題～～！？","zh":"诶诶诶～～！？作业～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"83b71ffa68a4d246c5a10786a5262e8fce0ad83b741d51c43bfa5dc6fad0b665","ja":"真美の貴重なゲーム時間を、お勉強のギセイに\nするなんて……り、律っちゃんの鬼軍曹！！","zh":"居然要牺牲真美宝贵的游戏时间来学习……律子真是个魔鬼教官！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6039c2d431c8537fc0d9514d830c95e9cec2a3168cfbbd6edc0e051caf549c26","ja":"ふふん、何とでも言いなさい。ステージを\n成功させるためなら、鬼にも悪魔にもなるわ。","zh":"哼，随你怎么说。为了让舞台成功，我连鬼和恶魔都做得出来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c9b94fb6be3b0b77ff6391a47ae7edc2cd7d765c194c5bbf96333f62c4b0b055","ja":"ちゃんとやったか、三日後にチェックするからね！\nサボろうとしてもムダよ。","zh":"三天后我会检查你有没有好好做完哦！  \n就算想偷懒也没用。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_873.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3e31b18e98485a3c5f1e78bcebcd6235e882cbd9c12e517e173771c19fb6f228","ja":"うあうあ、そんな～。バイブスだだ下がりだよ～。","zh":"呜啊呜啊，怎么这样～气氛都跌到谷底了～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
